; array state initialised to the constant 0 array; the write makes a[0] = 1
; (an earlier version declared the zero after the state, which the reference parser rejects)
1 sort bitvec 2
2 sort bitvec 8
3 sort array 1 2
4 sort bitvec 1
5 zero 2
6 state 3 a
7 init 3 6 5
8 zero 1
9 one 2
10 write 3 6 8 9
11 next 3 6 10
12 read 2 6 8
13 eq 4 12 9
14 bad 13
